{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118556","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118556/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118556/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118556/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118556","id":4258907487,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7SKqi3","number":118556,"title":"Add `follow_focus` padding","user":{"login":"Joy-less","id":65855333,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1ODU1MzMz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65855333?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less","html_url":"https://github.com/Joy-less","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Joy-less/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5791,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-14T01:36:34Z","updated_at":"2026-04-14T19:24:02Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118556","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118556","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118556.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118556.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Adds the following theme constants for `ScrollContainer`:\r\n- `focus_padding_left`\r\n- `focus_padding_top`\r\n- `focus_padding_right`\r\n- `focus_padding_bottom`\r\n\r\nThis adds padding to `ensure_control_visible` (used by `follow_focus`).\r\nFor example, if `focus_padding_top` is 100, then the scroll container will add an additional 100 pixels above the rect of the control in `ensure_control_visible`.\r\n\r\nWhen using `follow_focus` without padding, if you are using arrow keys to navigate buttons in a scroll container, then the focused button will always be at the very edge of the scroll container. The padding allows you to add some space inbetween the focused button and the edge of the scroll container.\r\n\r\nPartially implements https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/10244.\r\n\r\n## Demo project\r\n\r\n[follow-focus-padding.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26693465/follow-focus-padding.zip)\r\nPress tab to focus a button, then use arrow keys to move up/down the scroll container. There will always be 100 pixels between the focused button and the top edge of the scroll container (unless there is less than 100 pixels above the focused button).\r\n\r\nMoving to top of scroll container WITHOUT padding:\r\n<img width=\"1154\" height=\"680\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bc833ed6-9fb6-47b8-8e60-df7c03f24748\" />\r\n\r\nMoving to top of scroll container WITH padding:\r\n<img width=\"1154\" height=\"680\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a9a6af95-32a9-4292-8718-b11f7e797521\" />\r\n\r\n## Footnotes\r\n\r\n- I'm not sure if it should be called `padding` or `margin`, but I chose `padding` since it's calculated by increasing the rect of the focused control.\r\n- Since it applies to any usage of `ensure_control_visible` (not just `follow_focus`), it might be better to name it something like `target_padding` instead of `focus_padding`.\r\n- It could alternatively be implemented as a property on the `ScrollContainer` rather than a theme property.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118556/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118556/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}